      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a great idea, though a small icon should also be added to ensure this feature wouldn’t be dependent on color vision, plus it would make the reason for the highlight more obvious, especially if you can “hover” over it in the menu to get a tooltip or explanation",
      "viewerReactions": null,
