  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-15T04:05:15.201Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Moderating large instances with people in multiple places can be difficult as when a votekick is started there is no good way to find where both people are in the instance. Currently we need to run around the instance looking for the names however if the names changed colour this would help to identify where you should be running to eg. have the name change to purple for the person initiating the votekick and red for the person the votekick is against.\n\nChanging the name colours within the menu will also allow us to scroll through the list to find the name easier to manually kick the person which helps when they are in a small avatar moving around quickly so they cannot be selected easily.\n\nThe name colors should change back to their previous value when either:\n\nYou have responded to the votekick\n\nThe votekick has succeeded\n\nThe user has been kicked/banned manually by anyone\n\nThis could change for everyone in the instance however it is mainly beneficial for people with the \"Moderate Group Instances\" permission.",
